  /tmp/t6check/repo/internal/services/storage/zz_t6_symlink_check_test.go,
  TestT6_StorageSavePathReplacesSymlinkAndTargetGoesStale.
  `go test -count=1 -run TestT6_ -v ./internal/services/storage/` ->
    OK: after save, .../001/budget.csv is a regular file (mode -rw-r--r--)
