  The test asserts a precondition (Lstat shows ModeSymlink before the save),
  then asserts ModeSymlink is CLEAR and Mode().IsRegular() after, then asserts
  a SECOND save also fails to reach the old target — i.e. "goes stale" is
  asserted as an ongoing property, not just a one-shot miss.
  (First run of this test failed; cause was my own authoring error — I passed
